From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:30:43 +0200
Subject: [ARCHEOLOGY] rockchip64: rock-2: run the SD card at 50 MHz

> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > In UHS SDR104 mode at 100 MHz the SD card gave read errors, and files
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > were corrupted. At 50 MHz a 1 GiB write and read back test passes.
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
> X-Git-Archeology: - Revision 9a4e6bab29173ff26e618ddafee92455bfe703c2: https://github.com/armbian/build/commit/9a4e6bab29173ff26e618ddafee92455bfe703c2
> X-Git-Archeology:   Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:30:43 +0200
> X-Git-Archeology:   From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
> X-Git-Archeology:   Subject: rockchip64: rock-2: run the SD card at 50 MHz
> X-Git-Archeology:
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi
@@ -282,8 +282,8 @@ &sdmmc {
 	cap-mmc-highspeed;
 	cap-sd-highspeed;
 	disable-wp;
-	max-frequency = <100000000>;
-	sd-uhs-sdr104;
+	/* SDR104 at 100 MHz gave read errors and file corruption */
+	max-frequency = <50000000>;
 	vmmc-supply = <&vcc_3v3>;
 	vqmmc-supply = <&vccio_sd>;
 	status = "okay";
-- 
